WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.610
Open the repair in Resolution Center.

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:07.560
Start Work moves an open ticket into progress and tells the team someone has picked it up.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:14.100
If you're waiting for the instructor to test a spare microphone, choose Awaiting Response under Status and Assignment.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.530
In Resolution Log, choose Note.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.800
Record what you tried and who owes the next response, then press Enter.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.980
Check that the new entry appears in the log.
